<title>USA: Barnes &amp; Noble site to use Firefly software.</title>
<headline>Barnes &amp; Noble site to use Firefly software.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Firefly Network Inc said Monday it signed an agreement with Barnes &amp; Noble Inc to implement Firefly technology in the book store chain's site on the World Wide Web.</p>
<p>Using Firefly's suite of software tools, Barnes &amp; Noble will be able to create personalized communities online and register, recognize and deliver personalized content to consumers.</p>
<p>Barnes &amp; Noble plans to launch its World Wide Web site this spring, Firefly said.</p>
</text>
